;;; a hypothesis space as wide as the program's names allow: one relation of
;;; two places that nothing derives, no hypothesis rule, no list and no
;;; closure, so the blind enumerator guesses a fact of it for every pair of
;;; the names below
(relation person N :why "{?3} is a person")
(relation likes N N :why "{?3} likes {?4}")
